{"id":"3f02dbef75736ea3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md","title":"Shelah's PCF Theory","display":"df-shelah-pcf — Shelah's PCF Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-shelah-pcf","aliases":["58-df-shelah-pcf"],"display":"df-shelah-pcf — Shelah's PCF Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-shelah-pcf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-shelah-pcf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shelah-pcf — Shelah's PCF Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>（非空正则基数集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod A\\coloneqq\\{f:A\\to\\bigcup A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)&lt;a)\\}\">\\(\\prod A\\coloneqq\\{f:A\\to\\bigcup A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)&lt;a)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的超滤谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=_Ug\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in U\">\\(f=_Ug\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_U&lt;_U[g]_U\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)&lt;g(a)\\}\\in U\">\\([f]_U&lt;_U[g]_U\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)&lt;g(a)\\}\\in U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\prod A/U,&lt;_U)\">\\((\\prod A/U,&lt;_U)\\)</span>（约化积的商线序）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span>（线序的共尾数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span>（此处定义的 possible cofinalities）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{cf}(\\prod A/U,&lt;_U):\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{cf}(\\prod A/U,&lt;_U):\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> 收集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上各超滤约化积的可能共尾数。</li>\n<li>progressive 条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\min A\">\\(|A|&lt;\\min A\\)</span>；它不是定义 pcf 所必需，但支撑无最大元定理、生成元定理等核心结构结果。</li>\n<li>对 progressive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> 有最大元；这为奇异基数算术提供强约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$（正则基数谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)$（$A$ 上的超滤谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}$（线序的共尾数，见 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod A\\coloneqq\\{f:A\\to\\bigcup A:\\forall a\\in A\\;(f(a)<a)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"f=_Ug\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_U<_U[g]_U\\leftrightarrow\\{a\\in A:f(a)<g(a)\\}\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"(\\prod A/U,<_U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}pcf} \\vdash \\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\\bigr)\\to\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{cf}(\\prod A/U,<_U):\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\min A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1538,"backlinks":[{"id":"7644e449343b265a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2b198692bea0c160","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V$ is supplied by [[58-df-shelah-pcf]]"},{"id":"2579f81f77b3d245","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md|58-df-shelah-pcf]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","0fbfc19800246e77","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8"]}